 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The passive in -s",
   "texto": [
    "It is formed by adding **-s** to the right form: **sælges** (sold), **købes** (purchased), **åbnes** (opened). In the past there are forms like **byggedes**, but passive with **blev + participio** is usually more natural in a current narrative: **Huset blev bygget i 1950.** Passive in -s is common in formal rules, ads and records."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Without «af»",
   "texto": [
    "With the passive in-s, you almost never say who does the action. Compare: **Huset byggedes i 1950.** = The house was built in 1950.",
    "If you mean who did it, use another form: **Huset blev bygget af en arkitekt.** = The house was built by an architect."
   ]
